00:50:36.470 --> 00:50:39.940 align:middle line:84%
Yeah, that one's also one
of my favorite games.

00:50:39.940 --> 00:50:47.350 align:middle line:84%
This is looking at another kind
of sector of art, the

00:50:47.350 --> 00:50:49.135 align:middle line:84%
activist political statement
sector of art is doing that

00:50:49.135 --> 00:50:52.040 align:middle line:84%
through games, and it's
something-- this music too

00:50:52.040 --> 00:50:53.280 align:middle line:90%
